OL,3,GNEWSAArmy officer killed by reversing
OL,4,AWarrior with faulty alarm - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Army officer died when a Warrior
OL,7,Farmoured vehicle with a broken safety
OL,8,Falarm was reversed into him, an inquest
OL,9,Fhas been told.
OL,11,FSecond Lt Max George, 26, of Durham,
OL,12,Fdied at the scene of a training
OL,13,Fexercise on Salisbury Plain, Wiltshire,
OL,14,Fon 21 June 2022.
OL,16,FThe ongoing inquest at Wiltshire and
OL,17,FSwindon Coroner's Court heard an alarm,
OL,18,Fwhich was designed to alert the driver
OL,19,Fwhen the Warrior's rear doors were
OL,20,Fopen, had been faulty since 2018.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
